      "title": "Creation is not governance completion",
      "eyebrow": "Learn",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "Account Factory provisions and enrolls accounts into a governed landing zone using standardized account settings. The onboarding request supplies approved inputs and baseline checkpoints; creation is only part of the task.",
          "role": "definition",
          "lineage": {
            "concept_ids": [
              "aws_devops.execute_an_established_managed_account_onboarding_workflow"
            ],
            "teaching_block_ids": [
              "aws_devops.execute_an_established_managed_account_onboarding_workflow#tb1",
              "aws_devops.execute_an_established_managed_account_onboarding_workflow#tb2"
            ],
            "fact_ids": [
              "aws_devops.execute_an_established_managed_account_onboarding_workflow#f1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "Execute the established provisioning workflow with the approved account inputs. Inspect enrollment and organizational-unit placement, then verify each supplied baseline checkpoint against evidence of the account’s applied controls. Do not invent new baseline controls.",
          "role": "workflow",
          "lineage": {
            "concept_ids": [
              "aws_devops.execute_an_established_managed_account_onboarding_workflow"
            ],
            "teaching_block_ids": [
              "aws_devops.execute_an_established_managed_account_onboarding_workflow#tb3",
              "aws_devops.execute_an_established_managed_account_onboarding_workflow#tb4"
            ],
            "fact_ids": [
              "aws_devops.execute_an_established_managed_account_onboarding_workflow#f2",
              "aws_devops.execute_an_established_managed_account_onboarding_workflow#f3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "If the account was created but a checkpoint has no supporting result, record that distinction. Creation, enrollment and placement do not replace the checkpoint comparison. A created account alone does not demonstrate governance completion.",
          "role": "misconception",
          "lineage": {
            "concept_ids": [
              "aws_devops.execute_an_established_managed_account_onboarding_workflow"
            ],
            "teaching_block_ids": [
